WAITING FOR FRED

  Nothing.

WATCH OUT

  - Never invoke git commit -a or git add -A: tam-knox commits only the
    explicitly staged file paths in the active repository.
  - Pushing main or test always requires explicit user confirmation.
  - Follow tamlinux/arch/keybindings.md: no Meta bindings, no Alt+Left/
    Right or Alt+F1..F12, and no double-acting Ctrl codes.
